OL,3,GNEWSATexas know-how part of UK efforts
OL,4,Ato tame wildfires
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis week a record 350 delegates
OL,7,Fattended the UK Wildfire Conference in
OL,8,FLeeds. It was the first time since 2011
OL,9,Fthat the event had been in the north of
OL,10,FEngland and came against a backdrop of
OL,11,Fa record number of wildfires across the
OL,12,FUK.
OL,14,FTexas may seem a long way from
OL,15,FYorkshire, but Leeds is where Johnny
OL,16,FDavidson shared his wisdom when it
OL,17,Fcomes to tackling wildfires that have
OL,18,Fspread to people's homes and
OL,19,Fbusinesses.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
