OL,3,GNEWSATexas know-how part of UK efforts
OL,4,Ato tame wildfires
OL,5,
OL,6,FA captain of the Round Rock Fire
OL,7,FDepartment back home, he is also an
OL,8,Finstructor with the International
OL,9,FAssociation of Fire Fighters (IAFF),
OL,10,Fspecialising in what he calls "the
OL,11,Fwildfire/urban interface".
OL,13,FWhat was once a problem elsewhere in
OL,14,Fthe world has now become a stark
OL,15,Freality in the United Kingdom.
